[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2484511864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99413#issuecomment-2484511864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99413","id":2484511864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UFqR4","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T01:22:46Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T01:33:25Z","body":"**Note:** it's not a critical error, everything works so far. The error message constantly appears in the Android editor as soon as a project is started. (also Logcat - Android Studio)\r\n\r\n_Tested also on MacMini M1 Molten / Vulkan, `VK_QUEUE_TRANSFER_BIT` is available there._\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bab8a9c-13b9-49e9-a16a-b700b3280400)\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fd4c29a189e53a1e085df5b9b9a05cac9351b3ef/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp#L6142-L6150","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2484511864/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2484532914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99413#issuecomment-2484532914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99413","id":2484532914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UFvay","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T01:45:16Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T01:47:01Z","body":"I'm afraid this seems like the wrong way to fix the problem and it just adds more complexity to code that shouldn't have it.\r\n\r\nIf the issue is that the error message shows up, then I suggest making a PR to handle this...\r\n```\r\nERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(picked_family_index >= queue_family_properties.size(), CommandQueueFamilyID(), \"A queue family with the requested bits could not be found.\");\r\n```\r\n...as a correct case instead and just make it return the empty Id without printing an error.\r\n\r\nTo further support that, the code that calls this already handles the empty Id properly:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fd4c29a189e53a1e085df5b9b9a05cac9351b3ef/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp#L6142-L6151\r\n\r\nSo to me it just looks like a case of an error message that shouldn't be printed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2484532914/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2487108162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99413#issuecomment-2487108162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99413","id":2487108162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UPkJC","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-20T01:15:59Z","updated_at":"2024-11-20T01:15:59Z","body":"> ... However, the existence of the compute bit implies the capability of transfer, so it should be possible to use asynchronous compute queues if they're supported.\r\n\r\n> ... and I think it's subject to some testing if it actually gives much of a benefit on Android devices.\r\n\r\nAndroid devices with multiple `queue families` are very rare (and very expensive).\r\nSuch smartphones have only been available for a few weeks. It will probably only be worth looking into it in more detail in 2 to 3 years.\r\n\r\n`Adreno (TM) 830` (like `Xiaomi 15 (Pro)` for 900+ €)\r\nhttps://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/displayreport.php?id=34702#queuefamilies\r\n\r\n<details><summary>screenshots</summary>\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d094666-71f1-4e1e-9815-c2c9201a38dc)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69ee6827-fc8e-4cb8-b751-6255dc7a80f1)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2487108162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488983427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99413#issuecomment-2488983427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99413","id":2488983427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UWt-D","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a